  "recorded_at_utc": "2026-09-21T02:04:00Z",
  "claim": "Passwordless loopback dashboard access was qualified with eight direct native HTTP responses and scoped browser checks. Dagu's recurring Basic challenge was removed using upstream auth.mode none; its DAG execution/wiki-write denials remained. The official Qdrant UI was installed and existing collections remained visible. AgentsView now uses a scoped user service. OmniRoute's supported dashboard-login setting was disabled while anonymous gateway requests remained rejected.",
  "limitations": [
    "Current-host dashboard/API integration acceptance, not a complete upstream test suite, provider inference, broker execution, performance comparison, or token-saving benchmark.",
    "Dagu auth none and OmniRoute requireLogin false permit ordinary local administration. Dagu's DAG permission flags do not make all APIs read-only. Keep these profiles on loopback; remote access needs appropriate upstream authentication.",
    "Qdrant collection-name equality and green statuses do not establish byte-identical storage. Qdrant's UI exposes the existing management API; it is not a read-only client.",
    "AgentsView uses the existing explicit archive with no syncing/import. The initial unmanaged process disappeared; exact termination cause is unknown. The supervised replacement was verified after restart, not physical-PC reboot.",
    "Native agent-browser default sessions rendered the selected pages. A prior allowed-domains profile broke Grafana relative URL resolution; separate late archive navigation timed out while its unmanaged server was absent. Both failures remain retained, and final supervised archive rendering passed.",
    "Hosted Context Mode Insight was not enrolled, purchased, or connected to local telemetry. Its account authentication remains separate.",
    "Selected upstream test sources informed permission probes; their Go test suites were identified but not executed in this dashboard configuration wave."
  ],
